}",1,CWE-264,linux-2.6,7d91d531900bfa1165d445390b3b13a8013f98f7,39399206799500277043829635192449295004,7,"[PATCH] i386 vDSO: use install_special_mapping

This patch uses install_special_mapping for the i386 vDSO setup, consolidating
duplicated code.

